OL,3,AHundreds of thousands expected in Paris
OL,4,Afor Pope's visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV embarks on a four-day
OL,7,Fvisit to France on Friday, with the
OL,8,Fhighpoint being a giant Mass attended
OL,9,Fby more than half a million people in
OL,10,Fcentral Paris.
OL,12,FFor Saturday's afternoon celebration,
OL,13,Fan altar has been built on the Place de
OL,14,Fla Concorde and a large area around the
OL,15,FChamps-Elysees sealed off by police.
OL,17,FSome 600,000 Catholic faithful are
OL,18,Fexpected to cram the avenue up to the
OL,19,FArc de Triomphe and beyond.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
