OL,3,AHundreds of thousands expected in Paris
OL,4,Afor Pope's visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FLarge crowds are also due at other
OL,7,Fstages in the Pope's itinerary,
OL,8,Freflecting an enthusiasm that the
OL,9,FChurch attributes to growing spiritual
OL,10,Fthirst among the French and other
OL,11,FEuropeans.
